m_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/dd7269e7ea63d02dd3ae7f678d2038a3.mp4?t=1758830137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is tied to the tempo. Shooting, dashing, and reloading in sync with the heart-pounding electronic score unleashes devastating damage and keeps you alive in the fray. Miss the beat, and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your skills to the limit across intense, hand-crafted levels and face off against colossal biomechanical bosses. Master your run, climb the global leaderboards, and etch your name into the digital annals of the cyberpunk metropolis, Pioneer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official soundtrack is a brutal electronic onslaught, but your music library is your arsenal. The revolutionary music import feature lets you weaponize any song and will let you play in a procedurally generated level that will let you feel the song's crescendo or the beat drop. Systematically dismantle the corporate machine to the brutal beat of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.poster.avif?t=1758830137\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.webm?t=1758830137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/0e28c5470c5b20e8475ad979b84b9d94.mp4?t=1758830137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneer is a dying world of chrome and sin. Experience a visceral, high-octane campaign through a dystopian metropolis brought to life with brutalist cyberpunk architecture and blistering visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BEAT NEVER STOPS. NEITHER DO YOU.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.poster.avif?t=1758830137\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.webm?t=1758830137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/extras/4a64ca74a55e0606dd5c1222e9a08c87.mp4?t=1758830137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A high-octane rhythm FPS where the music is your weapon. Fight through a cyberpunk metropolis, facing biomechanical bosses to a pulsing electronic score or your own imported tracks.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/header.jpg?t=1758830137", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758830137", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758830137", "website": "https://www.tempopunk.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-3450 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><s